Error [E0928]: `test` is reserved by Jet's command line
  --> tests/ui/E0928_job_reserved_name.jet:13:1
    |
 13 | #Job fn test() {
    | ^^^^
 Why: `run`, `dev`, `build`, and `test` name Jet's lifecycle entries, and a built program answers `help` and `version` itself
 Fix: rename the job, e.g. `#Job fn test_all()`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0928

